DATASET_TITLE ACC: CCRs Test Series, Straight Road
#MiscYellow0
! Adjust the start speed of the GVT ahead of
! the ego vehilce (instantiated in Procedure)
Vx_GVT = 0
#ENDMYellow

#RingCtrl8 1
NUM_CACHED_RUNS 1
#RingCtrl9 

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB: Autonomous Emergency Braking
#ACC: Automatic Cruise Control
#GVT: Global Vehicle Target
#VUT: Vehicle Under Test (ego vehicle)
#FCW: Forward Collision Warning
#LKAS: Lane-Keeping Assistance System
#CCRs: Car-to-Car Rear, Stationary GVT
#
#This ACC example is based on a test scenario published by Euro NCAP for AEB systems with modified conditions. The GVT is stationary, on a straight road, and a variety of speeds are simulated for the vehicle with ACC:
#- No steering controller is used, as LKAS is keeping the vehicle within it's lane, per the Euro NCAP spec.
#- The GVT speed is defined with an output parameter Vx_GVT that can be set as a constant or managed with an equation.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

